msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ах..."

#: scenario:scenario_0064EE85_B55F_4F23_BFFE_56AA12E5CDD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d58ac57125274fbca86a63a9d2e145afb71fc2756bfdb84d20f39f251061c25d
